{"ts":"2026-08-28T09:51:15.011Z","type":"narrative","title":"Narrative updated","text":"The project moved from a visual redesign into a versioned storefront system. The current phase expands the full mode with original brand content, social/support links, new-product merchandising and a validated delivery/payment checkout while preserving the one-page experience and strict source-integrity boundaries.","tags":["narrative"]}
